---
description: How this repo uses poteto's pstack
alwaysApply: true
---

pstack is vendored at `vendor/pstack` (https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack).

- Default entry: `/poteto-mode` → read `.claude/skills/poteto-mode/SKILL.md`, which loads `vendor/pstack/skills/poteto-mode/SKILL.md`.
- Model overrides: `.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc` (every role is `cursor-grok-4.6-high-fast`).
- Desktop Cursor: `/add-plugin pstack` still works; the vendor copy is for cloud agents and non-Cursor harnesses.
- Do not copy pstack skill bodies into `.cursor/skills/` (those files are routers to `.claude/` only).
- Project TDD authority remains `docs/methodology/tdd.md`. pstack's `/tdd` playbook may wrap it; do not skip the red-green-refactor rules.
